  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tdqc](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tdqc) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 65.164 depth occurred on Sep 02 2026 6km SE of Yakepa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.1815 longitude 146.1539. It impacted 74050 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
